%% One signal. Queue, error ratio, drops, and mean latency each have their own copy.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Under
  Under --> Opened: rises and cooldown has elapsed
  Under --> Held: rises during cooldown
  Opened --> Under: falls below the threshold
  Held --> Under: falls below the threshold
  Opened --> Opened: stays at or above
  Held --> Held: stays at or above

  note right of Opened
    This crossing stored one report.
    Staying hot does not store another.
  end note
  note right of Held
    The rise was real, but the last report
    for this signal is still inside 120s.
  end note
